        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 9:44PM EDT until September 28 at 4:00AM EDT by NWS Buffalo NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 20 knots and waves 3 to 5 feet
expected Saturday. Northeast winds 20 to 25 knots and waves 4
to 7 feet expected Sunday.

* WHERE...The nearshore waters from Hamlin Beach to Mexico Bay.

* WHEN...From 6 AM Saturday to 4 AM EDT Monday.

* IMPACTS...Winds and/or waves will cause hazardous conditions
that could capsize or damage small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
